{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 45","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/321154f27d2c3ae616307cbb467ab2d1a14cb25e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\log_3 x\\right)\\left(\\log_x 2x\\right)\\left( \\log_{2x} y\\right)=\\log_{x}x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"274\" height=\"19\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/5/3b5ddff559118a52e2d40a78eece2fa87c13bbbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac92\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 9\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 18\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 27\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"379\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the properties of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithms\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Logarithms\">logarithms</a>, we can simplify the equation and solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />:\n\\begin{align*}\n(\\log_3 x)(\\log_x 2x)(\\log_{2x} y) &amp;= \\log_{x}x^2 \\\\\n(\\log_3 2x)(\\log_{2x} y) &amp;= 2\\log_x x \\\\\n\\log_3 y &amp;= 2 \\\\\ny &amp;= 3^2 \\\\\ny &amp;= 9\n\\end{align*}\nThus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3b09e18d34b772e1ca5645f83afb72619997262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 44\">Problem 44</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 46\">Problem 46</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"